# Credential template for the authorization-control research programme.
#
# The experimental programme is CLOSED. Reruns are not part of normal handoff
# (see README.md, "Reproduction / scripts"). You only need a credential if you
# are deliberately re-executing an API-calling runner.
#
# Each API-calling experiment reads a CELL-LOCAL .env from its own directory,
# not this root file. To run one, copy this template into that directory:
#
#     cp .env.example phase3_p3a_surface/.env
#
# Then fill in the value locally. .env and .env.* are gitignored and must never
# be committed. Offline checks and analysis-only scripts need no credential.

# Anthropic API key (Console -> API keys). Static workspace-scoped key.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=your-anthropic-api-key-here

# Note on key type, from the original working copy:
# A static workspace-scoped key works with these runners as written. An
# identity-linked key additionally requires an `anthropic-workspace-id` header,
# which the runners in this programme do not send. If you use an identity-linked
# key, expect an auth failure rather than a code bug.
